      "title": "AMQP: Fix dissection of PDUs split across TCP segments",
      "message": "AMQP: Fix dissection of PDUs split across TCP segments\n\nAMQP calls a subdissector table before tcp_dissect_pdus() is used to\ndesegment PDUs (see commit 27c10ed72ea2451bfbb6c0eb50af4280e65a3fcf),\nso pinfo->can_desegment needs to be restored before it is decremented\na second time.  Fixes #14217.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-08-25T17:24:31.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
